# Walkthrough — LTX-2 Weight Setup & Pipeline Pivot

We have successfully completed the massive weight download and pivoted the project from the "Lite" placeholder to the full LTX-2 pipeline with a robust startup experience.

## Accomplishments

### 1. Weight Acquisition (~44GB)
- **LTX-2 Main Weights**: Fully downloaded and verified in [weights/](file:///c:/just-dub-it/server.py#79-91).
