### 2. Pipeline Integration
- **Server Pivot**: [server.py](file:///c:/just-dub-it/server.py) now uses the real [JustDubitPipeline](file:///c:/just-dub-it/packages/ltx-pipelines/src/ltx_pipelines/pipeline_justdubit.py#95-497).
